# Planr Design

Invoke `planr pipeline design-engine` with the user's design subcommand and
repository-relative artifact paths. The command owns rendering, manifests, review
state, and safe file updates; keep those mechanics out of the prompt.

Use the host's native question surface only when a missing source, format, or
design direction would materially change the result. Preview the generated local
artifact, apply pinned feedback when requested, and return the artifact path,
design-spec path, validation state, and next useful action. Sharing and moving into
PLAN remain separate user choices.
